WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
- So earlier we were talking about music,

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.340
so I have to ask what are some songs

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.217
you go to when you're down?

00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:07.200
- "Wet Ass (beep)."

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:11.167
(audience laughing)

00:00:22.995 --> 00:00:24.696
- Oh, my god!

00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:25.613
I love you!

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.925
Oh, my god, I'm done.

00:00:28.925 --> 00:00:29.758
I'm done.

00:00:31.571 --> 00:00:32.863
I literally...

00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:35.363
I need to see the tape back.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.636
I felt like I was like, "Oh, wait, what?"

00:00:39.636 --> 00:00:41.670
(audience laughing)

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.803
That was amazing!

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:44.930
Oh!

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.926
God, you win for favorite
guest this season.

00:00:47.926 --> 00:00:48.857
(Kelly laughs)
- Oh, my god.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.530
- [Kelly] No, that was amazing.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.833
I needed that in my soul.

